  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Bluff 10 ranks, Bluster sphere (Fabricate Memory).</p>\n<p>If you outwit the target as a cost, you can use Fabricate Memory to make the target remember something they would otherwise think is impossible or that would contradict a memory they feel strongly about. Successfully doing so makes the target shocked for 1d4 hours. When the condition ends, they can attempt a new saving throw to end the fabrication and restore their memories; if this second save fails, the rewrite is permanent.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bluster#toc51\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
